# Responsive UI/UX

Every new or changed UI must work on **mobile (<768px)**, **tablet (768–1023px)**, and **desktop (≥1024px)**.

## Breakpoints (Tailwind defaults)

| Prefix | Min width | Use for |
|--------|-----------|---------|
| default | 0 | Mobile-first base styles |
| `sm` | 640px | 2-column grids, show button labels |
| `md` | 768px | Persistent sidebar, inline toolbars |
| `lg` | 1024px | Flow Designer side panel always visible |

## Layout shell

- Pages inside the app use `AppShell` (not auth pages).
- Sidebar: **drawer + backdrop** below `md`; persistent rail at `md+`.
- Use `useSidebar().openMobileSidebar()` for hamburger buttons (see `PageHeader`, chat header).
- App height: `h-dvh` (not `h-screen`). Page scroll: `flex-1 overflow-y-auto`.

## Page content pattern

```tsx
<main className="flex-1 overflow-y-auto">
  <div className="max-w-*xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 sm:py-6 space-y-6">
    {/* content */}
  </div>
</main>
```

## Headers & toolbars

- `PageHeader` for non-chat pages; chat has its own stacked header.
- Row 1: menu (mobile) + title + primary actions.
- Row 2 (mobile) or inline (`md+`): secondary controls (provider/model, filters).
- Header actions: `flex flex-wrap gap-2`; icon-only below `sm` with `title` attribute:

```tsx
<button title="New agent" className="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 sm:px-3 py-1.5 ...">
  <PlusIcon className="w-4 h-4" />
  <span className="hidden sm:inline">New agent</span>
</button>
```

## Grids & forms

- Never bare `grid-cols-2` — use `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2`.
- Card/action rows: `flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-3`.
- Flex rows with text: always `min-w-0` on flex children + `truncate` on titles.

## Panels & modals

- Side panels (citations, flow tools): full-width overlay on mobile, fixed width on `sm+`.
- Backdrop click closes mobile overlays.
- Modals: `fixed inset-0 ... px-4` + `max-w-sm` / `max-w-xl`.

## Touch & safe areas

- Tap targets ≥ 44px (`p-2.5` minimum on icon buttons).
- Bottom bars (input): add `safe-area-bottom` utility.
- Avoid horizontal overflow; code/markdown uses existing `.prose-chat` scroll rules.

## Checklist before shipping UI

- [ ] Tested at ~375px, ~768px, ≥1280px widths
- [ ] No horizontal scroll on page shell
- [ ] Mobile menu opens/closes; nav closes drawer
- [ ] Forms and grids stack on mobile
- [ ] Actions reachable without overflow/clipping
